1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,120
and rewrite what the enemy thought was already settled

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,930
if you are praying with me

3
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:07,070
wherever you are in the world

4
00:00:07,070 --> 00:00:11,670
open your heart surrender every fear to the Lord

5
00:00:11,670 --> 00:00:13,720
and believe that heaven

6
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:16,840
is already moving on your behalf

7
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:19,550
let us pray Almighty God

8
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:21,790
the creator of heaven and earth

9
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:25,170
the Alpha and the Omega the beginning and the end

10
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:28,100
the one who spoke light into darkness

11
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:30,880
and life into emptiness

12
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:35,270
today I come before you with a grateful heart

13
00:00:35,270 --> 00:00:38,100
thank you for the priceless gift of life

14
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:40,860
thank you for watching over me throughout the night

15
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:44,070
while I slept you remained awake

16
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:47,020
while I knew nothing about the dangers around me

17
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:50,620
your mighty angels stood guard over my home
